| Order | Scope Contract | Dependencies | Risk Level |
|-------|---------------|--------------|------------|
| 1 | Scope 1: Fix Build Script | None | **CRITICAL** |
| 2 | Scope 2: Build Validation | Scope 1 | Medium |
